<title>NEW ZEALAND: Sky City result due on March 3.</title>
<headline>Sky City result due on March 3.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky City said on Tuesday it would announce its half year result on March 3.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
